// The chord menus: Shift held, 3 opens the edge ring (the edge mode on), 1 its Geometry group, all greyed
// with nothing chosen (1 again says why, and the ring stays); Backspace goes back up, Esc closes it.
// A face chosen, Shift held, 4, 1, 1 starts Extrude, and the mouse moving with Shift still held gives
// the full amount (a Shift held as it starts doesn't slow it); Shift let go and Enter: one undo step.
// Shift held, 4 and let go: nothing runs. The user's own ring (prefs "chords") replaces Shift+3's, an
// empty slot keeping its place. Shift+2 with nothing selected says to select a level mesh.
